  {
    "id": "mastodon-117208589338269532",
    "published_at": "2026-09-03T18:45:41.031000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-03T18:45:41.031000Z",
    "text": "One of our members built a 3D printed Battle/Death Racer. If you haven't heard of them: Death Racers are small motorized vehicles where the goal is to knock the hat off the other rider's figure. The more racers, the better the duels.\nNow he just needs a few more makers to build their own so the battles can finally begin.\n#hackerspace #makerspace #openworkshop #MunichMakerLab #MuMaLab #Kreativquartier #Kreativlabor #DIYMunich #3dprinting #deathracing #robotcombat",
    "html": "<p>One of our members built a 3D printed Battle/Death Racer. If you haven&#39;t heard of them: Death Racers are small motorized vehicles where the goal is to knock the hat off the other rider&#39;s figure. The more racers, the better the duels.</p><p>Now he just needs a few more makers to build their own so the battles can finally begin.</p><p><a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/hackerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>hackerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/makerspace\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>makerspace</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/openworkshop\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>openworkshop</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MunichMakerLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MunichMakerLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/MuMaLab\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>MuMaLab</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativquartier\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativquartier</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/Kreativlabor\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>Kreativlabor</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/DIYMunich\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DIYMunich</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/3dprinting\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>3dprinting</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/deathracing\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>deathracing</span></a> <a href=\"https://chaos.social/tags/robotcombat\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>robotcombat</span></a></p>",
